<title>UK: GMAC Canada sets 250 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC Canada sets 250 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GMAC CANADA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    18.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.86    PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.16    SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A-	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A3	  DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/CA/</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.70	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT UNITY BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
